{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-03T09:20:30.697Z","data":{"text":"Done. Summary of changes:\n\n- **`src/cli/approve.ts`**: `ApproveCommandOptions` extends `CommandInputs`; `approveCommand` uses `resolveInputs`/`inputs.config()` at the same load point; all output goes through `inputs.stdout` and `inputs.stderr` (warnings to stderr); `requestApproval` gets a `print` that appends `\\n`.\n- **`src/cli/confirm.ts`**: `print` is now required and receives the flag line without its newline; removed the `console.log` default.\n- **`tests/approve-confirm.test.ts`** and **`tests/approve-rejected-branch.test.ts`**: capture through `captureLogs`/process writes instead of console methods.\n- **`tests/command-inputs-approve.test.ts`** (new): flagged approve parity via `runCliCaptured` vs. direct writers on separate copies, plus a `--confirm` run proving flag lines reach stdout.\n\nTask verify passes; `pnpm verify` exits 0. Result written to `openspec/changes/142-command-inputs/.run/results/8.md`."}}
